    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Owning behavior",
      "items": [
        "Four homes are alternatives, not four writes.",
        "Memory supplements discovery; workflow and canonical repairs belong with their owner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Trust and limits",
      "items": [
        "Installing instructions grants no permissions or configured memory.",
        "ZIP integrity does not establish native discovery or correct host behavior."
